      "description": "The meme expresses extreme hatred toward women, which relies on the real-world concept of misogyny — a systemic prejudice and discrimination against women. This includes stereotypes that women are irrational, emotional, or less competent, which the meme implicitly invokes by using hateful language and framing it as a serious declaration.",
